#. Description of the 'Top P' (Float) field in DocType 'Raven Bot'
#: raven/raven_bot/doctype/raven_bot/raven_bot.json:225
msgid ""
"An alternative to sampling with temperature, called nucleus sampling, where the model considers the results of the tokens with top_p probability mass. So 0.1 means only the tokens comprising the top 10% probability mass are considered.\n"
"\n"
"We generally recommend altering this or temperature but not both."
msgstr ""
"这是 temperature 采样的替代方式，称为核采样（nucleus sampling），模型只考虑累计概率达到 top_p 的 token。因此 0.1 表示只考虑概率最高、累计占前 10% 的 token。\n"
"\n"
"我们一般建议只调整此项或 temperature 其中之一，不要同时调整。"

#: apps/web/src/components/features/settings/panels/Agents/AgentAITab.tsx:124
msgid "An alternative to sampling with temperature, called nucleus sampling, where the model considers the results of the tokens with top_p probability mass. So 0.1 means only the tokens comprising the top 10% probability mass are considered.\\n\\nWe generally recommend altering this or temperature but not both."
msgstr "这是 temperature 采样的替代方式，称为核采样（nucleus sampling），模型只考虑累计概率达到 top_p 的 token。因此 0.1 表示只考虑概率最高、累计占前 10% 的 token。\\n\\n我们一般建议只调整此项或 temperature 其中之一，不要同时调整。"

